 who I've seen lately, so I visited Noor Kranz today — could you log it for me?\", \"Also, I'm thinking of putting an album together and want to know how big it'd be — how many pictures have I got from Gryndiby?\", \"One more thing, I'm going through the group's spending before we all meet up, so could you show me the marimba collective expenses above 70 kronor?\"], [\"umm so I visited Noor Kranz today, can you log that?\", \"oh and uh, how many pics have I got from... from Gryndiby?\", \"ok different thing — the marimba collective expenses, um, just the ones above 70 kronor?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0046\", \"v\": [[\"I've owed Ebba for a while now and it's honestly starting to bug me, so could you go ahead and settle up my debt with Ebba?\"], [\"Could you please settle up what I owe Ebba?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0048\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind booking a table at a restaurant for tonight, please?\"], [\"It's been a long week already and I really don't feel like cooking, so could you book me a table somewhere at a restaurant tonight?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0049\", \"v\": [[\"um what paperwork have I got in, uh, Taxes?\", \"ok and what's the second one?\", \"and uh... Trombone?\"], [\"Could you tell me what paperwork I've kept in the Taxes folder, please?\", \"What is the second one, please?\", \"And what about the Trombone folder?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0050\", \"v\": [[\"whats the weather gonna be like tomorrow\"], [\"hey um what's the weather looking like, uh, tomorrow?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0051\", \"v\": [[\"We've been splitting so many costs lately that I've completely lost track of who paid what, so how much does Ebba owe me in marimba collective?\"], [\"how much does Ebba owe me in marimba collective\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0052\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me my, like, favourited pics? the ones I starred\"], [\"show me my fave pics pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0053\", \"v\": [[\"hey can you order some more printer ink online?\", \"oh, uh, never mind then\", \"ok um what documents have I got in the Payslips folder?\"], [\"can u order more printer ink online\", \"nvm\", \"whats in my Payslips folder\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0054\", \"v\": [[\"how much have i spent in marimba collective\", \"show me the expenses\", \"how many is that\", \"diff thing, which Grestoe tasks havent i done yet\", \"whats the steps for the clean one\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in marimba collective?\", \"Could you list its expenses, please?\", \"How many is that altogether?\", \"On another note, which of my Grestoe tasks haven't I finished yet?\", \"Could you show me the steps for the clean one, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0055\", \"v\": [[\"um what've I spent on in marimba collective? like, the expenses\"], [\"what expenses r in marimba collective\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0056\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what else is going on while I'm in Yangshuo, please?\"], [\"I'm trying to plan my days properly so I don't miss anything worthwhile — what else is going on while I'm in Yangshuo?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0057\", \"v\": [[\"last contact with Odhran Everard?\", \"texted Noor Thevsen, log it\"], [\"I feel like it's been ages since we were in touch and I want to check before I reach out — when was my most recent contact with Odhran Everard?\", \"Different thing, while it's fresh in my head — I texted Noor Thevsen, could you record that so I don't forget I did?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w02-0059\", \"v\": [[\"got any bouldering entries in my spending?\", \"whos in the Gryndiby trip group\", \"which docs go with the sands expense\", \"Gryndiby trip expenses above forty?\", \"wait quick one, what places r in my photo library\", \"ok back to the trip costs, the tickets one, which group is it in\"], [\"um do I have any, like, bouldering entries in my spending?\", \"ok and who's in the Gryndiby trip group?\", \"oh, uh, what documents go with the sands expense?\", \"and can you show me the Gryndiby trip expenses over, um, forty?\", \"hang on, sorry — can you list the places in my photo library?\", \"right, where were we — those trip expenses, the tickets one, what group's that in?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0003\", \"v\": [[\"um what photos have I got from, uh, Mevagissey Meadows?\", \"oh and um, what's in the photo bin?\", \"ok and, um, add a task to sort out the sherbet\"], [\"I'm hunting for a nice shot to print for the hallway — what photos do I have from Mevagissey Meadows?\", \"Different question, I think I might've deleted a few by accident — what photos are sitting in the bin right now?\", \"Oh, and it's been lurking in the cupboard forever, so can you add a to-do to sort out the sherbet?\"]]}","ttft_ms":26446,"type":"result","duration_ms":39918,"uuid":"ac1032cd-2f9f-4d13-9a3c-014d44d49755","ttft_stream_ms":1391,"time_to_request_ms":136,"first_content_frame_ms":1391,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21806735,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278356873.6636,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
